# Agent local state (AGENTS.md § 3, ephemeral cycles)
.agent/
# Local worktrees of this repository: other checkouts of the same history.
# They are not repository content, and a search that walks them finds
# dependencies and files that this tree does not have.
.worktrees/

# Archives are never repository content. Release artifacts and plan packages
